{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471410/extras/6465f1bac380987bb0cc785b5877b5b9.poster.avif?t=1752572828\" width=800 height=45 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471410/extras/6465f1bac380987bb0cc785b5877b5b9.webm?t=1752572828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Fight as part of the human defiance against the relentless <strong>Machine Legion</strong>. <br>Pick your <strong>android class</strong> and specialization,<strong> experiment with powerful gear</strong> and unending ways to <strong>upgrade your capabilities</strong>. Master the unique weapon mechanics, but be careful, no two runs are the same and death is permanent!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471410/extras/b0774af2f7b813cbb0a6b0edaf1f0181.avif?t=1752572828\" width=650 height=200 /></span><br><strong>New in SYNTHETIK 2:</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a7 NEW WORLD:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take possession of powerful <strong>Faction Arsenals</strong> and their varied gadgets and technologies! <br></li><li>Explore much more varied and <strong>complex environments</strong> with destruction, physics &amp; <strong>full 3D</strong>!<br></li><li>Fight the powerful <strong>Machine S.A.T Police Force</strong>,<strong> Chrono and Shock Squad</strong> and their bosses!<br></li><li>The <strong>Technology Ruleset v2</strong> elevates gameplay, faction and world design to a higher level!</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1471410/extras/e210e9e2ed3e446c4eeb536902b06da9.poster.avif?t=1752572828\" width=650 height=200 ><sourc